            "review_title": "Review at Healthy Farm Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lauren E\nLondon, United Kingdom42 contributions\n0\nBrilliant cheap vegan food in backpacker area\nDec 2019 • Friends\nReally lovely little vegan place in the centre of the backpacker area - it’s inexpensive, food comes quickly and is so tasty! You can pick your own noodles, veg and vegan faux meats and they’ll cook it into a dish for you. The food is fresh and tastes unbelievably good for the price. Definitely recommend this little gem!\nWritten December 11, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
