            "review_text": "Ester d\n80 contributions\n0\nInexpensive vegan restaurant in District 1\nNov 2019\nIf you are walking in the city centre and want a 100% vegan place that's not expensive, this is a good option! The quality of the food is not the best, and they offer all kinds of meat and fish in the vegan version (processed food), not very fresh. But it's an option, and the prices are much better than the other vegan places in D1.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 4, 2019",
