            "review_text": "Kimberly M\n10 contributions\n0\nMs K\nMar 2019 • Solo\nI’m not picky when it comes to vegan food, and usually just happy to encounter vegan options especially in foreign cities. However, this vegan burger they offered was not edible at all. I tried to have a few bites but it’s just the worst thing I have ever tasted. I tried the ice cream and that was good.. if I had to advise then I would say just get the ice cream and go somewhere else for dinner... although portion is very small and they weigh it so you need three servings to have an average size ice cream.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 22, 2019",
