            "review_text": "Mary S\n4 contributions\n0\nCool Concept\nJan 2019 • Couples\nI love the concept of choosing your own noodles and vegetables to be prepared for you. However, I think in this case it is executed poorly as everything is wrapped in plastic which seems very wasteful. \n\nI opted not to build my own bowl and instead I ate the wonton soup, which was absolutely delicious. \n\nI read a review below stating that the food isn't vegan - this is not true!!! They have a large selection of mock meats and offer imitations of many traditional dishes. \n\nThey also have a store in the back with a lot of vegan ingredients, including the largest selection of mock meat and fish I have ever seen (even a frozen whole 'lobster'!)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 16, 2019",
