            "review_text": "plebeian8\nMelbourne6 contributions\n0\nUnusual place. Good food. Reasonable price.\nSep 2018 • Solo\nWas looking for a vegetarian venue and came across this place by chance.\nThe concept is quite unique.\n\nWhen you are ready to order you are given a basket to select the ingredients you would like to have in your meal. \n\nYou pick the type of noodle, then the various types of mushrooms, tofu and vegetables. They then prepare the meal for you.\n\nThe food and service were good. The price reasonable.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 25, 2018",
