            "review_text": "Christine\nSan Diego, California134 contributions\n0\nCute concept\nApr 2018\nWhen you first walk in, You can see veggies on the wall! You get a basket, pick your veggies, noodles, vegan protein, and then give it to the cashier so they can cook it for you. I thought the whole idea of making it custom to what you liked was cool. The flavors were a bit bland but I just added their sauces that were on the side. We also ordered from the menu, I liked the wonton soup. I think the other food was just average though. \nBrothers both thought their soybean drink was bomb! So I guess you can try it! Enjoy. \nThis place also has a small vegan market if you wanna take items home to cook or prepare for yourself.\nRead more\nWritten April 20, 2018",
